:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Or copy the skill directory by hand — project-level (checked into the repo,\nshared with your team):"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"User-level (available in every project):"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Other agents (Claude Code, Cursor, Codex): the CLI installs the same skill directly —"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Packaged plugins with the same skill and MCP server: Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Kimi Code CLI, "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"plugins with the same skill and MCP server: Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Kimi Code CLI, OpenCode."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## What the agent can do with it"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The skill also covers project aliases (`wavespeed.json`), schema introspection, price/balance checks"},{"id":"p20s2","text":", and prediction history."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"MIT — same as the CLI."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**WaveSpeed AI** — AI image & video generation platform.\nTry it in the browser: **Image generator** "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"· **Video generator**"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
